{"kind":"domainmodel","module":"TravelApproval","entities":[{"id":"380d1466-ab64-45d5-86da-7022870b9210","name":"TravelRequest","kind":"persistent","x":100,"y":100,"attrs":[{"name":"RequestNumber","type":"String","validation":true},{"name":"TripTitle","type":"String","validation":true},{"name":"Justification","type":"String"},{"name":"StartDate","type":"Date and time"},{"name":"EndDate","type":"Date and time"},{"name":"EstimatedCost","type":"Decimal"},{"name":"Status","type":"Enumeration","validation":true,"def":"Draft"},{"name":"IsEscalated","type":"Boolean","def":"false"},{"name":"IsRetrospective","type":"Boolean","def":"false"},{"name":"SubmittedOn","type":"Date and time"},{"name":"DecidedOn","type":"Date and time"},{"name":"CurrentLevel","type":"Enumeration"},{"name":"CurrentStepActivatedOn","type":"Date and time"}],"doc":"A travel request. RequestNumber = origin letters + YY + 4-digit per-country counter, set at first save (BR013). Mandatory fields other than TripTitle are enforced at submit (VAL_TravelRequest_Submit), so a draft can be saved partly filled."},{"id":"43370e14-bca1-4e0e-a85a-39f244d962ce","name":"Country","kind":"persistent","x":360,"y":100,"attrs":[{"name":"Code","type":"String","validation":true},{"name":"Name","type":"String","validation":true},{"name":"IsActive","type":"Boolean","def":"true"}],"doc":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country. Seeded. Replaces the four country strings of F001 (architect decision, DA05)."},{"id":"1b7e0202-ad97-4a61-8b89-626efa60f7ce","name":"TravelPurpose","kind":"persistent","x":620,"y":100,"attrs":[{"name":"Title","type":"String","validation":true},{"name":"IsActive","type":"Boolean","def":"true"}],"doc":"Reason for travel. Seeded (Opportunity, Internal Meeting, External Meeting, Conference, Services). No admin screen in slice 1."},{"id":"283ea428-27e2-4ac6-8c42-4e9d53c0fe5a","name":"TravelProfile","kind":"persistent","x":880,"y":100,"attrs":[{"name":"DisplayName","type":"String","validation":true},{"name":"Email","type":"String","validation":true},{"name":"IsExempt","type":"Boolean","def":"false"}],"doc":"One row per person; links to the Administration.Account. HomeCountry is optional so a first SSO login can create a blank profile (UC001)."},{"id":"c474c131-40ec-4e20-aa8b-8f9954d03b79","name":"Responsibility","kind":"persistent","x":1140,"y":100,"attrs":[{"name":"Level","type":"Enumeration","validation":true}],"events":true,"doc":"The approver table (DA01): who approves at which level, for which country. Subject is set on Manager rows only. Finance-owned; edit screen deferred."},{"id":"62eeea49-84c2-401d-b83c-ca5a8758fb59","name":"ApprovalStep","kind":"persistent","x":1400,"y":100,"attrs":[{"name":"Sequence","type":"Integer","validation":true},{"name":"Level","type":"Enumeration","validation":true},{"name":"Decision","type":"Enumeration","validation":true,"def":"Pending"},{"name":"ActivatedOn","type":"Date and time"},{"name":"LastRemindedOn","type":"Date and time"},{"name":"DecidedOn","type":"Date and time"},{"name":"Comment","type":"String"},{"name":"SkipReason","type":"String"}],"doc":"One generic step per approval level, created at submit; exactly one is open (Pending) at a time. Kept beside the native Workflow for audit and Finance views."},{"id":"6b9ebfbf-6b3d-4e4f-866c-aecd5a497a12","name":"RequestEvent","kind":"persistent","x":100,"y":380,"attrs":[{"name":"EventType","type":"Enumeration","validation":true},{"name":"Decision","type":"Enumeration"},{"name":"FromStatus","type":"Enumeration"},{"name":"ToStatus","type":"Enumeration"},{"name":"Comment","type":"String"},{"name":"OccurredOn","type":"Date and time","validation":true}],"doc":"Append-only audit record (BR014, NFR003). No role may edit or delete; created only in SUB_RequestEvent_Write."},{"id":"9034e93d-3206-4cb2-9480-59a14c3fa259","name":"RequestRunningNumber","kind":"persistent","x":360,"y":380,"attrs":[{"name":"CountryCode","type":"String","validation":true},{"name":"LastNumber","type":"Integer","validation":true,"def":"0"}],"doc":"Counter per origin country for RequestNumber (BR013). Locked at increment. No association, no role access."},{"id":"8f62c718-c3da-4772-b323-ad46108d7576","name":"NotificationLog","kind":"persistent","x":620,"y":380,"attrs":[{"name":"EventType","type":"Enumeration","validation":true},{"name":"Status","type":"Enumeration","validation":true,"def":"Queued"},{"name":"Attempts","type":"Integer","validation":true,"def":"0"},{"name":"LastError","type":"String"},{"name":"OccurredOn","type":"Date and time","validation":true},{"name":"LastAttemptOn","type":"Date and time"}],"doc":"One row per notification attempt series (BR018, NFR001). A failure never blocks the action: the row is Failed, retried to 3 attempts, listed to Finance."},{"id":"e4e5d253-5659-451c-805f-7c9f43538c2c","name":"HomeSummary","kind":"nonpersistent","x":880,"y":380,"attrs":[{"name":"ToApproveCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"ReturnedToMeCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"ForActionCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"IsManager","type":"Boolean","def":"false"},{"name":"IsFinance","type":"Boolean","def":"false"},{"name":"TeamSubmittedCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"TeamPendingCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"TeamReturnedCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"AllSubmittedCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"AllPendingCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"FailedNotificationCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"}],"doc":"Per-viewer Home dashboard numbers and section flags (build-plan row 42). Built by DS_Home_Summary on every Home load, never stored."},{"id":"396604dd-629a-4037-b03a-baf5a532f634","name":"DecisionDraft","kind":"nonpersistent","x":1140,"y":380,"attrs":[{"name":"Mode","type":"Enumeration"},{"name":"Text","type":"String"}],"doc":"The approver's comment or reason before it is written to the open ApprovalStep (Approver cannot write ApprovalStep). Lives only for the decision."},{"id":"7413edbe-d727-4fde-ac03-4c068fe2f4f8","name":"SignedInUser","kind":"nonpersistent","x":1400,"y":380,"attrs":[{"name":"DisplayName","type":"String"}],"doc":"The signed-in person's display name for the top bar. Built by DS_SignedInUser on each page load, never stored."},{"id":"8cf4785f-96a2-414b-9049-ec6d4cd5021e","name":"ListState","kind":"nonpersistent","x":100,"y":660,"attrs":[{"name":"MyRequestCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"ForActionCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"DecidedCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"TeamCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"}],"doc":"Row counts that drive the empty states of the list pages (Requests_My, Approvals_Inbox, Team_Travel, Home). Built per page load by a DS_ListState_ flow, never stored."},{"id":"52399128-62af-477a-9790-db2b2768ab0b","name":"ApproverPreview","kind":"nonpersistent","x":360,"y":660,"attrs":[{"name":"Sequence","type":"Integer","def":"0"},{"name":"Label","type":"String"},{"name":"ApproverName","type":"String"},{"name":"Note","type":"String"},{"name":"IsSkipped","type":"Boolean","def":"false"}],"doc":"One line of the approver preview on the request form (F001 p-approvers): level label, person, reason. Built by DS_Approver_Preview, never stored."},{"id":"22908ad3-57dd-42ab-bc96-6126b9f56b54","name":"NotificationState","kind":"nonpersistent","x":620,"y":660,"attrs":[{"name":"FailedCount","type":"Integer","def":"0"}],"doc":"Row count behind the Notifications_Failed empty state and grid foot. Built per page load by DS_NotificationState_Failed, never stored."},{"id":"07773eed-528e-4e2a-bc1b-3eb2fd04f75d","name":"RequestViewer","kind":"nonpersistent","x":880,"y":660,"attrs":[{"name":"CanDecide","type":"Boolean","def":"false"}],"doc":"Per-viewer facts for Request_Details, built per page load, never stored. CanDecide: the signed-in user holds an open user task (Created or In progress) on this request's workflow."},{"id":"f1bf4606-fa27-4766-89d8-8d69b0e2bb65","name":"AssistantSession","kind":"nonpersistent","x":1140,"y":660,"attrs":[{"name":